This project builds from and its npm and standalone release archives redistribute
lite4mariadb 0.1.2, an independently maintained MariaDB WebAssembly build.
Upstream: https://github.com/shyim/lite4mariadb
npm: https://www.npmjs.com/package/lite4mariadb/v/0.1.2
License: GPL-2.0-only (see the dependency's COPYING file).
Original copyright and license notices remain applicable to MariaDB,
lite4mariadb and their bundled dependencies. Apache-2.0 does not replace them.

The adapter retains exact result values through lite4mariadb's raw query ABI.
The engine is rebuilt with a reviewed patch adding independent server sessions
and larger bounded capacity defaults. The PHP runtime and PDO ABI are unchanged.
The lockfile records the exact package integrity. Releases include the original
upstream package metadata, license, and source provenance information.

